`_make_space()` to GDScript.\r\n\r\nRegarding `_make_space()`, since it has a default implementation, so we always need to call `if (GDVIRTUAL_CALL())` to check if the virtual method is defined in GDScript. This might be a performance concern.\r\n\r\nI'd like to hear opinions on this by @godotengine/gdscript team and @reduz.\r\n\r\nIf this is problematic, I believe we should opt for the approach of implementing a child class like `JointLimitationExtension3D` as same way with https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99181.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, `JointLimitation3D` has other virtual functions in C++ that are only accessible via `#ifdef TOOLS_ENABLED` for drawing the gizmo. However, since I don't know how to correctly expose functions implemented only in the tools environment to GDScript, I won't do anything about this for now.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":470